        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/Ancestral/scene_smoothsnake.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 5cbb638f-3842-4920-af29-195988247473).Image",
        "Description": "Good morning 47,\ryour target is Mr. Lukeson. For many years he was a lawyer for many popular artists. Some of his cases were based on truth while some on lies. Mr. Lukeson has no barriers and will achieve victory at every trial. Our client was a victim of his professional lies and has lost an 10B dollar portrait from Italy. To not get suspected of ordered assassination he asked us to eliminate the target by accident.\rYou will also have to eliminate his private bodyguard to eliminate all traces.",
